name": "HighresScreenshot00146.png", "id": "163970600033098", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566678_163970603366431_5435931785999963108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7E57_xnBJUEQ7kNvwHRxWO0&_nc_oc=Adqgvw_V2fQpXV1hVGjLgXPwHx1tu5_4zbAtQBJmzc3-Xf6UBhdq9yE24z0JCuZ4dws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyIHouNgTiLXW3pnRs_2lLF4FxWuv4diQpVDoB8HxDfg&oe=6AFC8031"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iA1dgeMgeiUQ7kNvwH26QjR&_nc_oc=Adr03_ECwlOnZg_qJKpN1EuX2i33sB0u91gKZp_5XL5xqojldmKAMcwQK2FaaoxP5VY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTfG0_dIk4ulA-UX3aoN61mAnbZnrdnA0dmDUioT9mcNw&oe=6AFC7072"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1324311035174797", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984472_1324311038508130_2610060411856834928_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0GzNVPjCi4Q7kNvwFbv3wO&_nc_oc=AdoXI_xN10GyWwOVqjxZsRiWiNeVXeVvz1n6iDMNGoLp2rtbuk-aPRRnAqQUnScBG8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS1LghlCkbCshIs3NrxmhBQ5IISlWnRZ8YDavnsMrRb0Q&oe=6AFC6938"}, {"file_name": "CoverImage_Portrait.png", "id": "1021944422558335", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031612_1021944425891668_3460677483354056217_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0rRwUZjrhNsQ7kNvwHKFcFd&_nc_oc=AdoETNHf4vjoKOapzWwCmeh2TCDs1E4q7VRaICDS9tDYIezaEDXbVo9OUjRCU0Ci